{"content_hash": "0751ced778c6d2e3", "version_id": 613, "article_id": 62, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Guardians win Game 5 as Williams strikes out 12", "title_zh": "守护者队赢下第五场，威廉姆斯三振12人", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/10/cleveland-guardians-chicago-white-sox-alds-game-five-gavin-williams", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1780476871585-eb2a20b32d12?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8d2lsbGlhbXMlMjBzdHJpa2VzJTIwb3V0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjU5NzV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Diego Corona on Unsplash", "author": "Diego Corona", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cldiego?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/mma-fighters-grapple-and-punch-inside-a-fenced-fighting-cage-3Hw-Pc1Oovk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(306, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(344, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "9eb22a7a824f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 201, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Gavin Williams struck out 12 batters, and José Ramírez hit a home run. The Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday to win their playoff series.", "lead_zh": "加文·威廉姆斯三振了12名打者，何塞·拉米雷斯击出一支本垒打。克利夫兰守护者队周六以2比0击败芝加哥白袜队，赢下了这轮季后赛系列赛。", "preview": "The Guardians lost the first two games, so they had to win three games in a row. They completed this comeback in the best-of-five American L", "preview_zh": "守护者队输掉了前两场比赛，所以他们必须连赢三场。他们在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中完成了这次逆转。周一晚上，他们将在坦帕湾开启下一轮比赛。他们正努力自2016年以来首次打进世界大赛。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 601, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/62/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 78.987, "size_bytes": 477648, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 229, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f76eeb6/content/data/versions/613.json", "paragraphs": ["The Guardians lost the first two games, so they had to win three games in a row. They completed this comeback in the best-of-five American League Division Series. On Monday night, they will open the next round at Tampa Bay. They are trying to reach the World Series for the first time since 2016.", "Williams did not allow a hit until the sixth inning, when Kyle Teel hit a soft single. Two innings earlier, Ramírez had hit a two-run homer off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski came in and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied a Cleveland postseason record.", "Cleveland's pitchers struck out 21 batters in total, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox got only three hits and struck out 75 times over the series. Hunter Gaddis got four outs, and Cade Smith earned his first five-out save. He struck out the side in the ninth to end the game.", "Chicago became the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons. However, they have not won the World Series since 2005. Cleveland have not won the title since 1948, which is the longest drought among MLB teams."], "paragraphs_zh": ["守护者队输掉了前两场比赛，所以他们必须连赢三场。他们在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中完成了这次逆转。周一晚上，他们将在坦帕湾开启下一轮比赛。他们正努力自2016年以来首次打进世界大赛。", "威廉姆斯直到第六局才被击出安打，当时凯尔·蒂尔打出一记软弱的一垒安打。两局之前，拉米雷斯从肖恩·伯克手中击出一支两分本垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基登场并三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰季后赛纪录。", "克利夫兰的投手们总共三振了21名打者，这是九局季后赛中最多的。白袜队只得到三支安打，在整个系列赛中被三振75次。亨特·加迪斯拿下四个出局数，凯德·史密斯则收获了他职业生涯首次五出局救援成功。他在第九局连续三振三名打者，结束了比赛。", "芝加哥成为第一支在连续三个100败赛季后打进季后赛的球队。然而，他们自2005年以来就没赢过世界大赛。克利夫兰自1948年以来未夺冠，这是MLB球队中最长的冠军荒。"], "body": "The Guardians lost the first two games, so they had to win three games in a row. They completed this comeback in the best-of-five American League Division Series. On Monday night, they will open the next round at Tampa Bay. They are trying to reach the World Series for the first time since 2016.\n\nWilliams did not allow a hit until the sixth inning, when Kyle Teel hit a soft single. Two innings earlier, Ramírez had hit a two-run homer off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski came in and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied a Cleveland postseason record.\n\nCleveland's pitchers struck out 21 batters in total, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox got only three hits and struck out 75 times over the series. Hunter Gaddis got four outs, and Cade Smith earned his first five-out save. He struck out the side in the ninth to end the game.\n\nChicago became the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons. However, they have not won the World Series since 2005. Cleveland have not won the title since 1948, which is the longest drought among MLB teams.", "body_zh": "守护者队输掉了前两场比赛，所以他们必须连赢三场。他们在五场三胜的美联分区系列赛中完成了这次逆转。周一晚上，他们将在坦帕湾开启下一轮比赛。他们正努力自2016年以来首次打进世界大赛。\n\n威廉姆斯直到第六局才被击出安打，当时凯尔·蒂尔打出一记软弱的一垒安打。两局之前，拉米雷斯从肖恩·伯克手中击出一支两分本垒打。一次保送形成满垒后，埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基登场并三振了村上宗隆。威廉姆斯的12次三振追平了克利夫兰季后赛纪录。\n\n克利夫兰的投手们总共三振了21名打者，这是九局季后赛中最多的。白袜队只得到三支安打，在整个系列赛中被三振75次。亨特·加迪斯拿下四个出局数，凯德·史密斯则收获了他职业生涯首次五出局救援成功。他在第九局连续三振三名打者，结束了比赛。\n\n芝加哥成为第一支在连续三个100败赛季后打进季后赛的球队。然而，他们自2005年以来就没赢过世界大赛。克利夫兰自1948年以来未夺冠，这是MLB球队中最长的冠军荒。", "text": "The Guardians lost the first two games, so they had to win three games in a row. They completed this comeback in the best-of-five American League Division Series. On Monday night, they will open the next round at Tampa Bay. They are trying to reach the World Series for the first time since 2016. Williams did not allow a hit until the sixth inning, when Kyle Teel hit a soft single. Two innings earlier, Ramírez had hit a two-run homer off Sean Burke. After a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski came in and struck out Munetaka Murakami. Williams's 12 strikeouts tied a Cleveland postseason record. Cleveland's pitchers struck out 21 batters in total, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox got only three hits and struck out 75 times over the series. Hunter Gaddis got four outs, and Cade Smith earned his first five-out save. He struck out the side in the ninth to end the game. Chicago became the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons. However, they have not won the World Series since 2005. Cleveland have not won the title since 1948, which is the longest drought among MLB teams.", "vocab": [{"word": "strike out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "棒球术语，指投手让打者挥棒落空或被判三振", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "homer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "本垒打", "note": "口语说法，正式说法是 home run", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "comeback", "pos": "noun", "zh": "逆转，翻盘", "note": "指落后之后反败为胜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deficit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "落后分数，赤字", "note": "常用于体育中表示比分落后", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "postseason", "pos": "noun", "zh": "季后赛", "note": "常规赛之后进行的淘汰赛阶段", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drought", "pos": "noun", "zh": "长期缺失，荒", "note": "这里指长期没有夺冠", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "load the bases", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "形成满垒", "note": "棒球中三个垒上都有人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "save", "pos": "noun", "zh": "救援成功", "note": "投手在领先时上场并保住胜利", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reach the playoffs", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "打进季后赛", "note": "获得参加季后赛的资格", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "allow a hit", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "被击出安打", "note": "指投手让对方打出安打", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback", "summary_original": "Williams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the Cleveland Guardians beat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among MLB teams.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Williams strikes out 12 as Guardians blank White Sox to complete ALDS comeback\nWilliams fans 12 as Cleveland win decisive Game 5\nRamírez’s two-run homer provides only scoring\nGuardians to face Rays for place in World Series\nGavin Williams struck out 12, José Ramírez homered on a pitch just above home plate and the\nCleveland Guardians\nbeat the Chicago White Sox 2-0 on Saturday night to complete a comeback from a 2-0 deficit in their best-of-five American League Division Series.\nCleveland open the American League Championship Series at Tampa Bay on Monday night, seeking their first World Series appearance since 2016. The Guardians/Indians franchise have not won the title since 1948, the longest drought among\nMLB\nteams.\nGuardians pitchers struck out 21, the most in a nine-inning postseason game. The White Sox managed just three hits, putting only nine balls in play, and struck out 75 times over the series.\nTwo days after getting the save in Game 4, Williams became just the third pitcher in postseason history to get the last out of a game and start the following game when his team faced elimination in both.\nHe did not allow a hit until Kyle Teel looped a knuckle-curve into right field with two outs in the sixth, two innings after Ramírez homered for the second straight game, a two-run drive off Sean Burke.\nAfter a walk loaded the bases, Erik Sabrowski relieved Williams and struck out Munetaka Murakami.\nWilliams’s 12 strikeouts tied Cleveland’s record for a postseason game. He got 22 swings and misses, and his 24 strikeouts over three games tied for the second most in a best-of-five postseason series.\nHunter Gaddis followed Sabrowski and got four outs. Cade Smith finished for his first career five-out save, striking out the side in the ninth. He blew a fastball by Tristan Peters for the final out, setting off a celebration at Progressive Field.\nChicago, the first team to reach the playoffs after three straight 100-loss seasons, have not won the World Series since 2005.\nExplore more on these topics\nMLB\nCleveland Guardians\nChicago White Sox\nBaseball\nUS sports\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:46:14.061014", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.263, "sm": 100, "em": 262, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Guardians", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.812, "sm": 275, "em": 812, "cs": 4, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "lost", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.125, "sm": 825, "em": 1125, "cs": 14, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "the", "s": 1.137, "e": 1.238, "sm": 1137, "em": 1237, "cs": 19, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "first", "s": 1.25, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1250, "em": 1550, "cs": 23, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "two", "s": 1.562, "e": 1.738, "sm": 1562, "em": 1737, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "games", "s": 1.75, "e": 2.212, "sm": 1750, "em": 2212, "cs": 33, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ",", "s": 2.212, "e": 2.487, "sm": 2212, "em": 2487, "cs": 38, "ce": 39, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "so", "s": 2.487, "e": 2.587, "sm": 2487, "em": 2587, "cs": 40, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "they", "s": 2.6, "e": 2.712, "sm": 2600, "em": 2712, "cs": 43, "ce": 47, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "had", "s": 2.725, "e": 2.962, "sm": 2725, "em": 2962, "cs": 48, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "to", "s": 2.975, "e": 3.062, "sm": 2975, "em": 3062, "cs": 52, "ce": 54, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "win", "s": 3.075, "e": 3.338, "sm": 3075, "em": 3337, "cs": 55, "ce": 58, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "three", "s": 3.35, "e": 3.613, "sm": 3350, "em": 3612, "cs": 59, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "games", "s": 3.625, "e